# Result tables + data-visualization images only.
# Omit raw model outputs, launch scripts, logs, HTML galleries, etc.
*
!*/
!**/*.csv
!**/*.json
!**/*.jsonl
!**/*.png
!**/*.jpg
!**/*.jpeg
!**/*.webp
!**/*.gif
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Raw generations (MOSS / FLUX / intervention outputs)
**/images/**
**/gallery/**

# One-off validation snapshots that are single generated frames
**/validation/*.png
**/validation/*.jpg
**/validation/*.jpeg

# Human-review thumbnails of generations (not aggregate plots)
**/review/**
